OL,3,CCrews deal with boat fire and warn
OL,4,Cpeople to avoid the area
OL,6,FFirefighters are currently tackling a
OL,7,Ffire involving a boat at Gilkicker
OL,8,FPoint, Gosport.
OL,10,FCrews from Fareham, Gosport, Cosham,
OL,11,FHavant and Eastleigh were alerted at
OL,12,F12:10 when around multiple 999 calls
OL,13,Fwere made into the Hampshire and Isle
OL,14,Fof Wight Fire and Rescue Service.
OL,16,FMembers of the public are asked to
OL,17,Favoid the area due to the number of
OL,18,Femergency services vehicles on the
OL,19,Fscene.
OL,21,FMore to follow.
